    [Doc][Misc] Enable shared expert DP in GLM-5.3 950DT Prefill examples (#19546)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add `"enable_shared_expert_dp": true` to the two 950DT ordinary-PD
    Prefill scripts in the GLM-5.2/GLM-5.3 deployment guide, matching the
    supplied GLM-5.3 configuration. This is the only configuration change.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This is a documentation-only update to the Prefill example
    configuration.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Markdown lint and diff checks passed. Both updated JSON objects were
    parsed and checked to preserve every existing setting. The Chinese
    translation pipeline preserves the updated code blocks without PO
    changes. No hardware run was performed.
    
